---
import Fact from '../components/Fact.astro';
import PageHead from '../components/PageHead.astro';
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { site, compliance } from '../config/site';
// DRAFT STRUCTURE ONLY. Magda (as Information Officer) must approve the final text.
---
<Base title="Privacy notice" description="How Magda Jordaan collects, uses and protects personal information under POPIA.">
  <PageHead title="Privacy notice" />
  <section>
    <div class="wrap prose">
    <p class="todo">DRAFT — to be completed and approved by Magda before launch. Version {compliance.privacyNoticeVersion}.</p>

    <h2>Who is responsible</h2>
    <p>{site.name}, {site.address}. Information Officer: {site.name} (<Fact value={site.email} kind="email" missing="Email" />).</p>

    <h2>What I collect, and why</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Estate check answers and your name and email, to send you your report.</li>
      <li>Your marketing consent, if you tick the box, to send you articles. You can unsubscribe at any time.</li>
      <li>A record of your consent (date, time, form and IP address), because the law requires me to keep it.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Where it is stored</h2>
    <p>
      On secure servers operated by Supabase in the European Union, under a written agreement. POPIA section 72
      allows this transfer because the EU's data protection law gives equal or better protection.
    </p>

    <h2>Who sees it</h2>
    <p>Only me and the person who maintains this website. I never sell or share your information.</p>

    <h2>How long I keep it</h2>
    <p>Enquiries that don&rsquo;t lead to working together are deleted within 12 months. Client records are kept for as long as the law requires: at least five years for financial advice records under FAIS.</p>

    <h2>Your rights</h2>
    <p>
      You may ask to see, correct or delete your information, and object to direct marketing, by emailing <Fact value={site.email} kind="email" missing="Email" />.
      You may complain to the Information Regulator (inforegulator.org.za).
    </p>
  </div>
  </section>
</Base>
